
<view class="page {{motionOff ? 'motion-off' : ''}} safe-bottom route-page"><view class="hero"><button class="motion-toggle" bindtap="toggleMotion">{{motionOff ? '开启动效' : '暂停动效'}}</button><view class="eyebrow">行走山河 · 读懂历史</view><view class="module-title-row"><image class="module-feature-icon" src="/static/icons/route.png"/><view class="title">文化路线</view></view><view class="subtitle">按加入顺序规划，最多4站；支持调整顺序</view></view>
 <view wx:if="!route" class="theme-map-card gap"><view class="map-heading">腾讯地图 · 城市浏览</view><map class="map" latitude="{{places[0].city === '常州市' ? 31.78 : 31.57}}" longitude="{{places[0].city === '常州市' ? 119.97 : 120.30}}" scale="12" markers="{{overviewMarkers}}" include-points="{{overviewPoints}}" bindtap="pickOrigin"/><button wx:if="{{pendingOrigin}}" class="primary" bindtap="confirmOrigin">确认地图起点</button><view class="map-caption">可拖动查看真实街道；下方为站点顺序示意。</view><view class="map-heading">我的路线 · 山河行卷<text class="map-kind">顺序示意</text></view><view class="theme-map-viewport"><view class="theme-map-layer" style="transform:scale({{mapZoom}})"><image class="theme-map-art" src="/assets/map-route-{{places.length}}.svg" mode="scaleToFill"/><view wx:for="{{places}}" wx:key="id" class="map-pin" style="left:{{mapPoints[index].left}}%;top:{{mapPoints[index].top}}%" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="place"><view class="pin-number">{{index + 1}}</view><view class="pin-name">{{item.name}}</view></view></view><view class="map-tools"><button data-zoom="in" bindtap="zoomMap">＋</button><button data-zoom="out" bindtap="zoomMap">−</button><button data-zoom="reset" bindtap="zoomMap">复位</button></view><text class="map-watermark">英迹 · 山河有迹</text></view><view class="map-caption">只表示已选站点的参观顺序，不是道路路径。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="heading">我的时间预算</text><picker range="{{budgets}}" value="{{budgetIndex}}" bindchange="budget"><button class="ghost">{{budgets[budgetIndex]}} ›</button></picker></view><view class="metric-grid"><view class="metric"><view class="metric-value">{{visitMinutes}}</view><view class="fine">停留预算／分钟</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-value">{{walkMinutes === null ? '—' : walkMinutes}}</view><view class="fine">地图步行／分钟</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-value">{{totalMinutes === null ? '—' : totalMinutes}}</view><view class="fine">预计合计／分钟</view></view></view><view class="fine">停留默认每站30分钟，可自行调整；不包含排队、交通及预约等待。未计算步行路径时不估算总时长。</view><view wx:if="overBudget" class="budget-warning gap">预计合计超过你的时间预算，可减少站点或调整停留时间。</view></view>
 <button wx:if="places.length" class="ghost gap" bindtap="clear" disabled="{{busy}}">清空路线</button><view class="hint"><view class="heading">{{stage}}</view><view>已选 {{places.length}} 站 · {{pendingCount}} 处地图点位待确认</view><view class="fine">先选择地点，再核验入口，最后设置起点并计算路线。</view></view>
 <view class="row"><text class="label">{{originLabel}}</text><button class="ghost" bindtap="locate" disabled="{{busy}}">设置当前位置</button></view>
 <view wx:if="!places.length" class="empty">先在地点详情中加入想了解的场所。<button class="primary gap" bindtap="radar">去发现历史场所</button></view>
 <view wx:for="{{places}}" wx:key="id" class="card route-line route-station"><view class="row"><text class="number">{{index + 1}}</text><view><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="fine">{{item.routeReady ? '场馆附近点位可用' : '入口坐标待核验'}}</view></view></view><view class="row gap"><text class="fine">自定停留预算</text><picker value="{{stays[item.id] === 15 ? 0 : stays[item.id] === 45 ? 2 : stays[item.id] === 60 ? 3 : 1}}" range="{{stayOptions}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="stay"><button class="ghost">{{stays[item.id] || 30}}分钟 ›</button></picker></view><view class="chips"><button class="chip" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="place">查看地点</button><button class="chip" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="up" disabled="{{index === 0}}">↑</button><button class="chip" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="down" disabled="{{index===places.length-1}}">↓</button><button class="chip" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">移除</button></view></view>
 <view wx:if="error" class="hint">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="places.length" class="primary gap" bindtap="plan" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !ready}}">{{ready ? '计算步行路线' : '场馆点位待确认 · 暂不能计算'}}</button>
 <block wx:if="route"><view class="card"><view class="heading">步行约 {{route.durationMinutes}} 分钟</view><view class="gap">步行 {{route.distanceMeters}} 米 · {{route.provider}}</view><view class="fine gap">{{route.notice}}</view></view><map class="map" latitude="{{latitude}}" longitude="{{longitude}}" markers="{{markers}}" polyline="{{polylines}}" include-points="{{polylines[0].points}}"/><button class="ghost gap" bindtap="navigate">导航至第一站附近</button><view wx:for="{{route.legs}}" wx:key="placeId" class="card"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">本段 {{item.distanceMeters}} 米 · 约 {{item.durationMinutes}} 分钟</view><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:key="index" class="focus">{{step.instruction}}</view></view></block>
 <view wx:if="places.length" class="card plan-summary"><view class="eyebrow">我的文化路线 · 计划</view><view class="heading">{{places.length}}站历史探索</view><view class="gap" wx:for="{{places}}" wx:key="id">{{index + 1}} · {{item.name}}</view><view class="fine gap">停留预算{{visitMinutes}}分钟 · 此卡是路线计划，不代表已经到访。</view><button class="ghost gap" bindtap="copyPlan">复制路线计划</button></view><view class="hint">路线仅采用地图平台返回的真实道路路径；场馆开放与预约需出发前确认。未核入口不生成导航，示意连线不作为步行路线。</view></view>
